    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>These purity, concentration and moisture content tests allow our clients to determine the quality and readiness of different materials.</p>
<p>Our accredited laboratories and mobile facilities are equipped to perform the following chemical testing services according to testing standards set by ASTM, SANAS, BSI and more.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
